ace; a notch that fails these checks is refused, see `docs/decisions/2956-agie-reentrant-punch.md` and `docs/user-guide/agie-wire-edm.md`); milling posts refuse wire cuts by name. Neither built-in wire `.mch` ships with `edm.conditions`, and the wire posts are not exercised on a physical EDM control.
